From: catawalks <59056948+catawalks@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pstore/ram: 88PA61x0: CONFIG_MV61X0_RAMOOPS_NO_INIT test switch

Test option for the DP200 NAND-root hangs, off by default
(docs/kernel/nandboot_hang_analysis.md, hang 25).
---
--- a/fs/pstore/ram.c
+++ b/fs/pstore/ram.c
@@ -977,6 +977,10 @@
 {
 	int ret;
 
+	/* DP200 hang analysis (docs/kernel/nandboot_hang_analysis.md, hang 25) */
+	if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_MV61X0_RAMOOPS_NO_INIT))
+		return 0;
+
 	ramoops_register_dummy();
 	ret = platform_driver_register(&ramoops_driver);
 	if (ret != 0)
